      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Sanjeev from Re-Energy provided excellent and expert professional advice throughout our project (upgrading from lead acid to Simpliphi lithium ion batteries and replacement of existing inverter and charger units with a Schneider inverter charger unit with automatic generator backup). The upgraded system has performed beyond our expectations and we would happily recommend Re-Energy to anyone considering either a new solar power system or upgrade works to an existing installation.",
